menu "Pajoniiir network services"
config PAJONIIIR_DJ_LINK_SERVICE
    bool "Build experimental Pro DJ Link network library/cache/sync service"
    default y if PAJONIIIR_BOARD_JC1060
    default n
    help
        Uses only the explicitly supplied board network interface. JC1060
        retains its Ethernet provider. Other targets use a Wi-Fi STA provider
        for engineering experiments only. Runtime enable remains OFF by
        default; enabling this feature does not qualify any physical network.
endmenu
